WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:15.320
Am I allowed to hold this?

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.380
Oh, yeah yeah.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:19.320
Go on then.

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:20.300
Don't drop it.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:20.800
Four kilos.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.500
Four kilos...

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:39.760
I'm really excited, I've got here more than one and a half million pounds worth of platinum group metals.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:45.440
Never had so many in front of me all at once.

